# Keeps this directory in git.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY --from=builder /app/public ./public`, and git does not
# track empty directories — so on a clean clone the folder did not exist and the
# image build failed with "/app/public": not found. It built fine in any working
# tree where the directory happened to have been created locally, which is exactly
# why it survived testing.
#
# Static files served from the site root go here.
